/-!
The project API uses logarithmic coordinates on positive radii.  It is defined in
`LeanSpherical.Definitions` as `logDilationSet`, `logBall`, `entropyNumber`, and
`legendreAssouadFunction`, and re-exported into this namespace at the top of the
